{"chunk_id": "2195787f37ba", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "无标题", "date_hint": "2024年8月26日", "text": "2024年农村土地三轮承包讨论激烈，国家明确土地二轮承包到期后再延长30年，保障农民权益。农村承包地、宅基地确权完成，推进一户一宅、一户一田试点，加强耕地保护，激活土地活力。农民需关注政策变化，确保权益。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "2195787f37ba", "label": "pure_event", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "pure_event", "used_fallback": true}
